{"id":"a5s6","label":"Act 5, Scene 6","group":"Act 5","blocks":[{"k":"d","text":"Night. A heath, with fir-trees. A forest fire has been raging; charred tree-trunks are seen stretching for miles. White mists here and there clinging to the earth."},{"k":"d","text":"PEER GYNT comes running over the heath."},{"k":"s","text":"PEER"},{"k":"v","lines":["Ashes, fog-scuds, dust wind-driven,—","Here’s enough for building with!","Stench and rottenness within it;","All a whited sepulchre.","Figments, dreams, and still-born knowledge","Lay the pyramid’s foundation;","O’er them shall the work mount upwards,","With its step on step of falsehood.","Earnest shunned, repentance dreaded,","Flaunt at the apex like a scutcheon,","Fill the trump of judgment with their:","“Petrus Gyntus Cæsar fecit!”"]},{"k":"d","text":"Listens."},{"k":"v","lines":["What is this, like children’s weeping?","Weeping, but half-way to song.—","Thread-balls at my feet are rolling!—"]},{"k":"d","text":"Kicking at them."},{"k":"v","lines":["Off with you! You block my path!"]},{"k":"s","text":"THE THREAD-BALLS"},{"k":"d","text":"On the ground."},{"k":"v","lines":["We are thoughts;","Thou shouldst have thought us;—","Feet to run on","Thou shouldst have given us!"]},{"k":"s","text":"PEER"},{"k":"d","text":"Going round about."},{"k":"v","lines":["I have given life to one;—","’Twas a bungled, crook-legged thing!"]},{"k":"s","text":"THE THREAD-BALLS"},{"k":"v","lines":["We should have soared up","Like clangorous voices,——","And here we must trundle","As grey-yarn thread-balls."]},{"k":"s","text":"PEER"},{"k":"d","text":"Stumbling."},{"k":"v","lines":["Thread-clue! you accursed scamp!","Would you trip your father’s heels?"]},{"k":"d","text":"Flees."},{"k":"s","text":"WITHERED LEAVES"},{"k":"d","text":"Flying before the wind."},{"k":"v","lines":["We are a watchword;","Thou shouldst have proclaimed us!","See how thy dozing","Has wofully riddled us.","The worm has gnawed us.","In every crevice;","We have never twined us","Like wreaths round fruitage."]},{"k":"s","text":"PEER"},{"k":"v","lines":["Not in vain your birth, however;—","Lie but still and serve as manure."]},{"k":"s","text":"A SIGHING IN THE AIR"},{"k":"v","lines":["We are songs;","Thou shouldst have sung us!—","A thousand times over","Hast thou cowed us and smothered us.","Down in thy heart’s pit","We have lain and waited;—","We were never called forth.","Thy gorge we poison!"]},{"k":"s","text":"PEER"},{"k":"v","lines":["Poison thee, thou foolish stave!","Had I time for verse and stuff?"]},{"k":"d","text":"Attempts a short cut."},{"k":"s","text":"DEWDROPS"},{"k":"d","text":"Dripping from the branches."},{"k":"v","lines":["We are tears","Unshed for ever.","Ice-spears, sharp-wounding,","We could have melted.","Now the barb rankles","In the shaggy bosom;—","The wound is closed over;","Our power is ended."]},{"k":"s","text":"PEER"},{"k":"v","lines":["Thanks;—I wept in Rondë-cloisters,—","None the less my tail-part smarted!"]},{"k":"s","text":"BROKEN STRAWS"},{"k":"v","lines":["We are deeds;","Thou shouldst have achieved us!","Doubt, the throttler,","Has crippled and riven us.","On the Day of Judgment","We’ll come a-flock,","And tell the story,—","Then woe to you!"]},{"k":"s","text":"PEER"},{"k":"v","lines":["Rascal-tricks! How dare you debit","What is negative against me?"]},{"k":"d","text":"Hastens away."},{"k":"s","text":"ÅSE’S VOICE"},{"k":"d","text":"Far away."},{"k":"v","lines":["Fie, what a post-boy!","Hu, you’ve upset me!","Here in the slush, boy!","Sadly it’s smirched me.—","You’ve driven me the wrong way.","Peer, where’s the castle?","The Fiend has misled you","With the switch from the cupboard!"]},{"k":"s","text":"PEER"},{"k":"v","lines":["Better haste away, poor fellow!","With the devil’s sins upon you,","Soon you’ll faint upon the hillside;—","Hard enough to bear one’s own sins."]},{"k":"d","text":"Runs off."}]}